---
id: quotation-flow
title: Quotation Flow
---
flowchart TD
    A[Usuario abre lista de cotizaciones] --> B[GET /api/quotations con filtros: year, month, productType, status, search]
    B --> C[UI muestra: title, date, status, productType, images, lastEditedByName]
    C --> D{Crear o editar}
    D -->|Crear| E[GET /api/quotations/context - sin quotationId]
    D -->|Editar| F[GET /api/quotations/context - quotationId=ID]
    E --> G[Retorna catalogos, enums, costOfElectricity]
    F --> G
    G --> H[Usuario captura cotizacion + version + supplies + assets]
    H --> I[Adjunta imagenes en la misma solicitud]
    I --> J[POST /api/quotations o PUT /api/quotations/id]
    J --> K[Valida datos y sube imagenes]
    K --> L[Calcula costos: supplies + assets + labor + extraCosts]
    L --> M[Guarda Quotation, QuotationVersion, SuppliesQuotation, AssetsQuotation]
    M --> N[Respuesta: QuotationContextResponse]
    N --> O[UI muestra detalle y totales]
